WS S3, Azure, local filesystem)\n- Docker containerization with docker-compose\n- Comprehensive testing suite and utility scripts\n- Sample import maps for microfrontend architecture\n- PowerShell and bash examples for API testing\n- Production-ready configuration with security considerations\n- Detailed documentation and usage examples\n\nFeatures:\n- RESTful API for managing import maps\n- Environment-specific deployments\n- Service deployment and backup utilities\n- Health checks and monitoring\n- URL validation and integrity hashing\n- Support for multiple storage backends","tree":{"sha":"27d31226e8147e4ab0017c74be631bdd6ef48588","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wildan-sleek/import-map-deployer-example/git/trees/27d31226e8147e4ab0017c74be631bdd6ef48588"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wildan-sleek/import-map-deployer-example/git/commits/480429d09c61ef3e8b78cb5471b8d0d5aea7a668","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233664265?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wildan-sleek/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wildan-sleek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wildan-sleek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wildan-sleek/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wildan-sleek","id":233664265,"login":"wildan-sleek","node_id":"U_kgDODe1vCQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wildan-sleek/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wildan-sleek/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wildan-sleek/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wildan-sleek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wildan-sleek/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wildan-sleek","user_view_type":"public"},"ht