, backup, scaling)\n  - Troubleshooting (common issues + solutions)\n  - Developer guide (references to other docs)\n  - Maintenance (regular tasks, updating, security)\n\nUpdates:\n- docs/README.md: Add owner''s manual to structure, update onboarding for users vs developers\n- Clear separation: Users → OWNERS-MANUAL.md, Developers → AI-AGENT-GUIDE.md\n\nDocumentation now serves 3 audiences:\n1. Users/Admins → OWNERS-MANUAL.md\n2. Developers → AI-AGENT-GUIDE.md + ADRs + quirks\n3. AI Agents → FOR-AI-CODING-AGENTS.md + docs/","tree":{"sha":"e5d431c07d01627ad78715c9181f0693f1106c56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/OLD-Chat-With-Docs-Plugin/git/trees/e5d431c07d01627ad78715c9181f0693f1106c56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/OLD-Chat-With-Docs-Plugin/git/commits/9ff17350df282fa5f58f00ef42490e1c855a1db2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47065940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov","id":47065940,"login":"bekmuradov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDY1OTQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/davewaring/OLD-Chat-With-Docs-Plugin/commit/9ff17350