y@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add search to model, persona, collection dropdowns + compact layout (#34)\n\n* feat: add search to model dropdown in evaluation modal\n\nAdd inline search functionality to Select component for filtering models when >1 options available.\n\nChanges:\n- Enhanced SelectContent with searchable prop and search input\n- Search auto-focuses when dropdown opens with >1 models\n- Filters models by name or server name\n- Shows ''No models found'' when search has no matches\n- Search clears when dropdown closes\n\nCloses #29\n\n* feat: add search to model, persona, collection dropdowns + compact layout\n\nAdd inline search to all three dropdowns in evaluation modal when >1 options available.\n\nChanges:\n- Enhanced SelectContent with searchable prop and integrated search input\n- Search auto-focuses when dropdown opens\n- Filters by name/description (case-insensitive)\n- Shows ''No X found'' when search has no matches\n- Search clears when dropdown closes\n- Compact 3-column layout for model/persona/collection\n- More space for questions textarea\n- Fixed textarea placeholder formatting (proper newlines)\n- Improved textarea focus styling (border highlight only)\n\nModel: filters by model name and server name\nPersona: filters by persona name\nCollection: filters by collection name and description\n\nCloses #29","tree":{"sha":"dee09f4c9b397b72a4b5ff59e7baef930a79631f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/OLD-Chat-With-Docs-Plugin/git/trees/dee09f4c9b397b72a4b5ff59e7baef930a79631f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/OLD-Chat-With-Docs-Plugin/git/commits/b9ef7166ef3da5c4c4d9143fb921e3465eff3bfa","verification":{"payload":"tree dee09f4c9b397b72a4b5ff59e7baef930a79631f\nparent d94f3c63f36c21222def96c12f62997ebd8a5fa8\nauthor Beck Bekmyradov <47065940+bekmuradov@users.noreply.github.com> 1763127100 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1763127100 +0400\n\nfeat: add search to model, persona, collection dro