red{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MalazAlkoj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MalazAlkoj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/esyfo-microfrontends/commits/f519468b9e87bc6b30ce6e736d27820097795146/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T12:50:14Z","email":"malaz.alkoj@nav.no","name":"Malaz Alkoj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T12:50:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"build(docker): bruk pnpm deploy for runtime-images (#313)\n\n* \"build(docker): fjern sårbare Go-binærer fra runtime-image\" \\                                                                                        ┃\n     -m \"Saniterer node_modules i Docker build slik at esbuild- og lefthook-binærer bygget med sårbar Go stdlib ikke kopieres til final image.                        ┃\n                                                                                                                                                                      ┃\n   Closes #312                                                                            ┃\n\n* build(docker): gjør node_modules-sanitering mer robust\" \\                                                                                           ┃\n     -m \"Lar Docker build fortsette hvis enten esbuild eller lefthook mangler i node_modules, men feiler fortsatt hvis ingen sanitize-kandidater finnes.              ┃\n                                                                                                                                                                      ┃\n   Closes #312\n\n* build(docker): kjør sanitering som root i build-stage\" \\                                                                                            ┃\n     -m \"Lar sanitize-steget slette kopierte node_modules-filer i intermediate Docker-stage uten å endre runtime-stage.                                               ┃\n                                                                                                                                                                      ┃\n   Closes #312\n\n* build(docker): bruk pnpm deploy for runtime-images\n\nBygger minimale deploy-artefakter med dist og production node_modules før Docker build, slik at build-time pakker ikke kopieres til final image.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7f71ede817b8e521f242cdd1b243e8ba032dd89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/esyfo-microfrontends/git/trees/a7f71ede817b8e521f242cdd1b243e8ba032dd89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/esyfo-microfrontends/git/commits/f519468b9e87bc6b30ce6e736d27820097795146","verification":{"payload":"tree a7f71ede817b8e521f242cdd1b243e8ba032dd89\nparent fda4dd9ba0603eb58adaf714bd6203ce02db2644\nauthor Malaz Alkoj <malaz.alkoj@nav.no> 1787575814 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787575814 +0000\n\nbuild(docker): bruk pnpm deploy for runtime-images (#313)\n\n* \"build(docker): fjern sårbare Go-binærer fra runtime-image\" \\                                                                                        ┃\n     -m \"Saniterer node_modules i Docker build slik at esbuild- og lefthook-binærer bygget med sårbar Go stdlib ikke kopieres til final image.                        ┃\n                                                                                                                                                                      ┃\n   Closes #312                                                                            ┃\n\n* build(docker): gjør node_modules-sanitering mer robust\" \\                                                                                           ┃\n     -m \"Lar Docker build fortsette hvis enten esbuild eller lefthook mangler i node_modules, men feiler fortsatt hvis ingen sanitize-kandidater finnes.              ┃\n                                                                                                                                                                      ┃\n   Closes #312\n\n* build(docker): kjør sanitering som root i build-stage\" \\                                                                                            ┃\n     -m \"Lar sanitize-steget slette kopierte node_modules-filer i intermediate Docker-stage uten å endre runtime-stage.                                               ┃\n                                                                                                                                                                      ┃\n   Closes #312\n\n* build(docker): bruk pnpm deploy for runtime-images\n\nBygger minimale deploy-artefakter med dist og production node_modules før Docker build, slik at build-time pakker ikke kopieres til final image.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjD4VCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADkMQAAUW5gd6GfKHpAuG0V0hf3wN\nk1q6SP5iNDaKjr/xfGXODKSNZ4jUC/ps3jBym8/Yin1Nclo8fBKuUlm/zYtLRjem\nlovVt3nU6CzFNLmvlwxBh/TQ5iu58vr8cE3zvxS0Dkk5lsZ3/gPH2j7aPhSHirmm\nSamrN0T5hD+7eglN2Lt3z2hbL/JNyBslwNVt3Dc7oD5Vbiz1djtKiQ4T8x+Mk3HB\nJ+HR8yu25Cqx0+A5wa2SboA/jyp7yC5RkId7L7lw+KtJ2wa9u9ejC5e9VrjFgBvs\ndZAZRCwNGj5TZadxFm8cCmonn/9Ew2HcebamKrofWr84OQEZQ+TqDvZ199opCHYf\n3fvDM10QACJmpAoSKFVNrpGUwgypgJokRqqnfmIqjpd+AO5MosoybsCqsm2A+hR4\nYKfToEatrdWvFuvIv1TukhSOJoBL2kmQKRT1HrnQIaYpzMZ0aex9dP1IC+YcwAot\ng6OA2QTQqNa8yNBV/cRKjC8sZatAKNciAxMskDOjIFJQF3IW5p9PsSlOwAN2a4b5\nbvHn2LuBc6NB/7bTNUtv0XA7JR8vI9fLNIH+2Ie2CAOZ+Y3myFlUqdmOr/3vwlwu\nDOniUp2LJY0mzPEEgo0lC02MOh4O4aVoQTm1MGUv0XyyYhL1i33hy+uk5WfugOqk\nE184kVwsZw11SU3qrGgX\n=+0pR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":tru