/f9f7d825ec85fe02f714fe0f126b9129533541f8","sha":"f9f7d825ec85fe02f714fe0f126b9129533541f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commits/f9f7d825ec85fe02f714fe0f126b9129533541f8"}],"sha":"1285063b4a81676a09cf01fb91c1487ccda79538","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commits/1285063b4a81676a09cf01fb91c1487ccda79538"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220909633?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/analisaperlengkapan","id":220909633,"login":"analisaperlengkapan","node_id":"U_kgDODSrQQQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commits/f9f7d825ec85fe02f714fe0f126b9129533541f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T09:57:56Z","email":"analisaperlengkapan@gmail.com","name":"analisaperlengkapan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T09:57:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(perlengkapan): readiness authenc yang tak pernah bisa gagal (#866)\n\n`check_authenc_health` memprobe authenc dengan\n`validate_token(\"health_check_token\")` lalu mencocokkan `Ok(_) | Err(_)`.\nLengan itu total, jadi fungsinya HANYA bisa mengembalikan `Healthy` — termasuk\nsaat authenc mati. Padahal doc comment `readiness_check` di file yang sama\nmenjanjikan 503 \"when any hard dependency (DB, Authenc) is down\", dan untuk\nauthenc itu tak pernah mungkin terjadi.\n\nString itu juga bukan JWT, jadi setiap probe membuat authenc mencatat\n`Token validation failed: Invalid token: Invalid JWT format`. Dibuktikan dengan\ndelta terkendali di staging: 20 permintaan ke `/health` menghasilkan tepat 20\nbaris tambahan. Dengan readiness tiap 5 detik + liveness tiap 10 detik pada 2\nreplika, itu ~37 galat autentikasi per menit tanpa satu pun pengguna — persis\nsinyal yang orang cari saat membaca log authenc.\n\nSekarang memakai RPC `HealthCheck` milik authenc: itu tujuannya, ia mencatat di\n`debug`, dan `Err` darinya benar-benar berarti tak terjangkau.\n\nChart-nya juga: ketiga probe menunjuk `/health`, endpoint DETAIL yang mengecek\nDB + Redis + authenc + circuit breaker. `/health/live` dan `/health/ready` sudah\nada di `main.rs` sejak awal dan tak pernah dipakai. Dua akibatnya: liveness\nmembayar query DB tiap 10 detik, dan begitu health check authenc BISA gagal,\nliveness akan me-RESTART pod karena dependensinya mati. authenc\n(values.yaml:342-356) sudah memakai pemisahan yang benar; perlengkapan satu-\nsatunya backend yang tidak. Migrasi refinery jalan sebelum bind (main.rs:272 vs\n:542), jadi respons HTTP apa pun sudah menandakan migrasi selesai — `/health/live`\nsah untuk startup.\n\nKetiga endpoint diverifikasi 200 pada pod staging yang berjalan sebelum\nmemindahkan probe ke sana.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AUqQeBUFcU2eAw2EZwRgwn\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ddd75a190a367e2e74ad6bc3830d58d035df23a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/git/trees/1ddd75a190a367e2e74ad6bc3830d58d035df23a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/git/commits/f9f7d825ec85fe02f714fe0f126b9129533541f8","verification":{"payload":"tree 1ddd75a190a367e2e74ad6bc3830d58d035df23a\nparent 147a8bb511a4c2c7d1543fc741e336b005242301\nauthor analisaperlengkapan <analisaperlengkapan@gmail.com> 1787911076 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787911076 +0000\n\nfix(perlengkapan): readiness authenc yang tak pernah bisa gagal (#866)\n\n`check_authenc_health` memprobe authenc dengan\n`validate_token(\"health_check_token\")` lalu mencocokkan `Ok(_) | Err(_)`.\nLengan itu total, jadi fungsinya HANYA bisa mengembalikan `Healthy` — termasuk\nsaat authenc mati. Padahal doc comment `readiness_check` di file yang sama\nmenjanjikan 503 \"when any hard dependency (DB, Authenc) is down\", dan untuk\nauthenc itu tak pernah mungkin terjadi.\n\nString itu juga bukan JWT, jadi setiap probe membuat authenc mencatat\n`Token validation failed: Invalid token: Invalid JWT format`. Dibuktikan dengan\ndelta terkendali di staging: 20 permintaan ke `/health` menghasilkan tepat 20\nbaris tambahan. Dengan readiness tiap 5 detik + liveness tiap 10 detik pada 2\nreplika, itu ~37 galat autentikasi per menit tanpa satu pun pengguna — persis\nsinyal yang orang cari saat membaca log authenc.\n\nSekarang memakai RPC `HealthCheck` milik authenc: itu tujuannya, ia mencatat di\n`debug`, dan `Err` darinya benar-benar berarti tak terjangkau.\n\nChart-nya juga: ketiga probe menunjuk `/health`, endpoint DETAIL yang mengecek\nDB + Redis + authenc + circuit breaker. `/health/live` dan `/health/ready` sudah\nada di `main.rs` sejak awal dan tak pernah dipakai. Dua akibatnya: liveness\nmembayar query DB tiap 10 detik, dan begitu health check authenc BISA gagal,\nliveness akan me-RESTART pod karena dependensinya mati. authenc\n(values.yaml:342-356) sudah memakai pemisahan yang benar; perlengkapan satu-\nsatunya backend yang tidak. Migrasi refinery jalan sebelum bind (main.rs:272 vs\n:542), jadi respons HTTP apa pun sudah menandakan migrasi selesai — `/health/live`\nsah untuk startup.\n\nKetiga endpoint diverifikasi 200 pada pod staging yang berjalan sebelum\nmemindahkan probe ke sana.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AUqQeBUFcU2eAw2EZwRgwn\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkVukCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABHAQAGg3aMcq6ZhN54BMKdlkcTs1\nOCtxtbjTrL02C7ISj0ZWoDSzJknl/pec9jdx26L8xJmkAQHIXPoGiTGpQLwVmDpS\nyXUKuZ4rQ8RBeRcZyiLTiwkWoVP3WeU41hLCwWZMIEv76ejJ2XHpF4RyPjTE+PQg\neDLsqKNURnVN7/THhPqWMVGbqWafHLR9vHZrNBsH2ukY2W1ZFPkPvvGWPGGHoxZe\n0jVzfEc1D5jRG12frTibRQLqs5vGqWg4nchCc0Z3puinrAvPP+EpSmQDFgpXVuI0\n+69mZa1eK6NTMxVm9EH9DA+XTbu39OkULUuQjvy9m1GPJNxAle+cj1TT9nzVJUUl\nrB3uz6bc6P2QqkpBVKBsgDEAKukTj1I4phUsHA1UL22FZZvMDKUSjZiI9XlKGsjt\nR5tmAGXjGodAAuNzsTE3MNMuyLdyMtIbWoogZqfmSlAMwzNaE5jLO53+5l29Vu2J\nK1FnSKfuaWUqCvMf3MCZ6ClYMg+GKSVH+QG7W5igvgz85yFObaxpECVyyKZEeMUA\nInKYDCBvIGnVQhJamxaTa2KxCvvIR3s5ZSjXcgN8nPMii9SRFpnu48BD3eXPUsRT\nu2yjepaYlnAE9ctjF5tvHdaHzxaY5rdjyANTLbI/B26gZRK7zQkO6CWEg6m/ER9y\nQAw5tH4TvQJut93bf9vH\n=Jf7o\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-28T09:57:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commit/f9f7d825ec85fe02f714fe0f126b9129533541f8","node_id":"C_kwDOP93DxNoAKGY5ZjdkODI1ZWM4NWZlMDJmNzE0ZmUwZjEyNmI5MTI5NTMzNTQxZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commit/147a8bb511a4c2c7d1543fc741e336b005242301","sha":"147a8bb511a4c2c7d1543fc741e336b005242301","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commits/147a8bb511a4c2c7d1543fc741e336b005242301"}],"sha":"f9f7d825ec85fe02f714fe0f126b9129533541f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commits/f9f7d825ec85fe02f714fe0f126b9129533541f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220909633?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/analisaperlengkapan","id":220909633,"login":"analisaperlengkapan","node_id":"U_kgDODSrQQQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commits/147a8bb511a4c2c7d1543fc741e336b005242301/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T08:43:54Z","email":"analisaperlengkapan@gmail.com","name":"analisaperlengkapan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T08:43:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(infra): integrasi tak bisa dihubungi siapa pun selama 3 hari (#865)\n\n`allow-incluster-egress` mengizinkan egress ke `layanan-integrasi` pada port\n50053. Tidak ada yang mendengarkan 50053 — Service-nya mengekspos 50051 (gRPC)\ndan 8080 (HTTP). Karena policy itu memakai `podSelector: {}`, yang menyeret\nSETIAP pod ke rezim egress-restricted, satu digit salah memutus integrasi untuk\nseluruh namespace. Ingress-nya juga tak pernah ada: authenc, postgres, secreton,\ndan redis masing-masing punya policy sendiri di balik `default-deny-ingress`,\nintegrasi terlewat. Jadi jalurnya tertutup dari kedua arah sekaligus.\n\nTidak ada satu pun sinyal merah. Probe/health hijau, `helm lint` hijau,\nkube-linter hijau — manifesnya sah, hanya salah. Yang menyembunyikannya adalah\n`is_integrasi_sync_risky`, yang memperlakukan kegagalan probe sebagai \"tidak\nmemblokir keputusan\" lalu tetap MENUNGGU: 25 detik untuk mysimkari, 30 detik\nuntuk siman, berurutan, di jalur mutasi yang dipakai pengguna. Terukur di\nstaging pada `keputusan-pusat`:\n\n    07:34:11.717  mulai\n    07:34:36.900  mysimkari menyerah   (+25,2s)\n    07:35:06.935  siman menyerah       (+30,0s)\n    07:35:06.960  seluruh kerja DB selesai (+0,025s)\n\n55 detik, 0,025 detik di antaranya adalah pekerjaan sebenarnya. Gateway memutus\nklien di 30 detik, jadi tiap persetujuan Validator Pusat mengembalikan 504\npadahal transisinya berhasil ~20 detik kemudian lewat `cancel_safe`.\n\nTemuan kedua di sepanjang jalan: `PORTAL_URL` bernilai\n`http://portal:3000/portal` di semua environment. Nilai itu dikirim ke BROWSER\nsebagai redirect oleh `TokenToOAuthMiddleware`, jadi ia harus alamat yang bisa\ndijangkau browser — `portal` tak bisa di-resolve dari luar cluster, dan\nVirtualService pun mengarahkan portal ke 8080, bukan 3000. Production bahkan tak\npernah menimpanya, jadi ia mewarisi default yang rusak itu.\n\nPenjaganya menurunkan cakupan dari render, bukan daftar tulis tangan: port dari\nobjek Service, pasangan yang dibutuhkan dari URL yang benar-benar dikonfigurasi.\nDiuji dua arah — pada chart sebelum perbaikan ia melaporkan ketiga kegagalan\nintegrasi, pada chart sesudahnya ia lulus.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AUqQeBUFcU2eAw2EZwRgwn\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6b789bfb55cc341332d1c43a4742cc986451f44f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/git/trees/6b789bfb55cc341332d1c43a4742cc986451f44f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/git/commits/147a8bb511a4c2c7d1543fc741e336b005242301","verification":{"payload":"tree 6b789bfb55cc341332d1c43a4742cc986451f44f\nparent 1333099a0a53760062e82995e69e5b5305e394ff\nauthor analisaperlengkapan <analisaperlengkapan@gmail.com> 1787906634 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787906634 +0000\n\nfix(infra): integrasi tak bisa dihubungi siapa pun selama 3 hari (#865)\n\n`allow-incluster-egress` mengizinkan egress ke `layanan-integrasi` pada port\n50053. Tidak ada yang mendengarkan 50053 — Service-nya mengekspos 50051 (gRPC)\ndan 8080 (HTTP). Karena policy itu memakai `podSelector: {}`, yang menyeret\nSETIAP pod ke rezim egress-restricted, satu digit salah memutus integrasi untuk\nseluruh namespace. Ingress-nya juga tak pernah ada: authenc, postgres, secreton,\ndan redis masing-masing punya policy sendiri di balik `default-deny-ingress`,\nintegrasi terlewat. Jadi jalurnya tertutup dari kedua arah sekaligus.\n\nTidak ada satu pun sinyal merah. Probe/health hijau, `helm lint` hijau,\nkube-linter hijau — manifesnya sah, hanya salah. Yang menyembunyikannya adalah\n`is_integrasi_sync_risky`, yang memperlakukan kegagalan probe sebagai \"tidak\nmemblokir keputusan\" lalu tetap MENUNGGU: 25 detik untuk mysimkari, 30 detik\nuntuk siman, berurutan, di jalur mutasi yang dipakai pengguna. Terukur di\nstaging pada `keputusan-pusat`:\n\n    07:34:11.717  mulai\n    07:34:36.900  mysimkari menyerah   (+25,2s)\n    07:35:06.935  siman menyerah       (+30,0s)\n    07:35:06.960  seluruh kerja DB selesai (+0,025s)\n\n55 detik, 0,025 detik di antaranya adalah pekerjaan sebenarnya. Gateway memutus\nklien di 30 detik, jadi tiap persetujuan Validator Pusat mengembalikan 504\npadahal transisinya berhasil ~20 detik kemudian lewat `cancel_safe`.\n\nTemuan kedua di sepanjang jalan: `PORTAL_URL` bernilai\n`http://portal:3000/portal` di semua environment. Nilai itu dikirim ke BROWSER\nsebagai redirect oleh `TokenToOAuthMiddleware`, jadi ia harus alamat yang bisa\ndijangkau browser — `portal` tak bisa di-resolve dari luar cluster, dan\nVirtualService pun mengarahkan portal ke 8080, bukan 3000. Production bahkan tak\npernah menimpanya, jadi ia mewarisi default yang rusak itu.\n\nPenjaganya menurunkan cakupan dari render, bukan daftar tulis tangan: port dari\nobjek Service, pasangan yang dibutuhkan dari URL yang benar-benar dikonfigurasi.\nDiuji dua arah — pada chart sebelum perbaikan ia melaporkan ketiga kegagalan\nintegrasi, pada chart sesudahnya ia lulus.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AUqQeBUFcU2eAw2EZwRgwn\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkUpKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALyoQAHJY2VhD2pM6b4S/7uYcwYAU\nk6AmUYnbQfQgcMrvYkeIYERTVvrFJ8cfruZis7NjvTw94XKX8f07DSMhCW663QgX\n5bZSLzC0PAkBPiYjyYrB5169YK5FnlfczhvREEpN8JCML8JVb3UpbQ36RfaZZbng\nY6LuYZKy2HS90JvZVBokdUh60MVzjy+R6zWXh7wwZs1bRFnVVH1V7MjIAmFdMhYp\nQlsDYuCtB081SI7O2bQMlRzHjPnyRu5aVNNricd/riIVv/h/LMJnYU2ob8E1JMpI\nAXORTZeLVrLi0AL+Bc2/6heHIqzY7ZIelB+hZlkhUxQkvijpxu7kAzjQ7L1hJow9\nWVD0wWaRP6VJ8XRxlDLYVhK1CGrgvJXBRD4g+tgA9eE7zRm0EDvDmb0f3CvksB3V\nMsMb4x4va+hSYvdDbCn1z8kr3rtmKyZJ7l/eRFSsUyAe+yKZTA+lopAMvf/wkh6s\na0m000wLoTF4z5ie8bj7VbNUkIA59S2LkTAd8fkF+nnNRnvCEtsvwVsSMwUdy0L/\n5fg2uCj2cBdW488954VY1GMcibkWyltE1RnyXht5mqhbiKY9CCcJOpbf6CU1ahH+\nVZbeP/y4mshXob3sxAEtMPLXhHBKqCx2ID79PfyGfv6HQY5SRl7h15SrTRvz+CzH\nRZNI5govoQXm0not+1h7\n=Mnmt\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-28T08:43:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commit/147a8bb511a4c2c7d1543fc741e336b005242301","node_id":"C_kwDOP93DxNoAKDE0N2E4YmI1MTFhNGMyYzdkMTU0M2ZjNzQxZTMzNmIwMDUyNDIzMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commit/1333099a0a53760062e82995e69e5b5305e394ff","sha":"1333099a0a53760062e82995e69e5b5305e394ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commits/1333099a0a53760062e82995e69e5b5305e394ff"}],"sha":"147a8bb511a4c2c7d1543fc741e336b005242301","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commits/147a8bb511a4c2c7d1543fc741e336b005242301"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220909633?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/analisaperlengkapan","id":220909633,"login":"analisaperlengkapan","node_id":"U_kgDODSrQQQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commits/1333099a0a53760062e82995e69e5b5305e394ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T08:25:16Z","email":"analisaperlengkapan@gmail.com","name":"analisaperlengkapan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T08:25:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(portal): every page load fetched five files that do not exist (#863)\n\nRunning the e2e suite against staging filled the console with\n\n    Failed to load resource: the server responded with a status of 404\n\non every page. Probed directly: /portal/favicon.png 404, /favicon.png\n404, /portal/fonts/inter-regular.woff2 404. Probed the other way —\n`find antarmuka/portal -iname ''*.woff2'' -o -iname ''favicon*''` returns\nnothing, and Trunk.toml copies only assets/* and styles/*.css. These\nfiles are not missing. They have never existed. perlengkapan''s\nindex.html does none of this, so it is portal-specific.\n\nindex.html preloads three .woff2 files and declares four @font-face\nrules whose url() is one of them. The url() half always 404s. The\nlocal() half adds nothing, because body already says\n\n    font-family: ''Inter'', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, ...\n\nwhich uses an installed Inter if there is one and falls through if there\nis not. So the @font-face blocks bought failed requests and not one\npixel. Removed; rendering is unchanged.\n\nThe favicon now points at a file that exists — assets/kejaksaan-logo.png,\nrelative so it resolves through <base href=\"/portal/\"> (verified 200 on\nstaging). Absolute /favicon.png is exactly why it 404''d behind the\ningress.\n\nsrc/utils/asset_optimization.rs is deleted. It preloads /favicon.png,\n/assets/logo.png (the real file is kejaksaan-logo.png) and the same three\nfonts. init_asset_optimization() has zero callers repo-wide, so it is not\npart of today''s 404s — it is the deferred version of them, waiting for\nwhoever wires it up.\n\nIts only test was\n\n    assert!(fonts.contains(&\"/fonts/inter-regular.woff2\"));\n\nwhich certified a path that 404s. A test can hold a mistake in place\ninstead of catching it, and this one did.\n\nFollow-up, deliberately not done here: lib/ui''s FontLoadingStrategy::\napply() hard-codes the same three dead paths. After this it has no\nconsumers left, but removing a public lib-ui API does not belong in a\nportal fix — it belongs with the FE dead-code audit.\n\nVerified: cargo check -p portal-microfrontend --target\nwasm32-unknown-unknown is green after the deletion.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AUqQeBUFcU2eAw2EZwRgwn\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"978d7a7ccdf7e3e9d2fdc9c6a6be7bc7db16b0af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/git/trees/978d7a7ccdf7e3e9d2fdc9c6a6be7bc7db16b0af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/git/commits/1333099a0a53760062e82995e69e5b5305e394ff","verification":{"payload":"tree 978d7a7ccdf7e3e9d2fdc9c6a6be7bc7db16b0af\nparent f68b9a7c8ee6583bb5c41aa1b34f4c8ff202f412\nauthor analisaperlengkapan <analisaperlengkapan@gmail.com> 1787905516 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787905516 +0000\n\nfix(portal): every page load fetched five files that do not exist (#863)\n\nRunning the e2e suite against staging filled the console with\n\n    Failed to load resource: the server responded with a status of 404\n\non every page. Probed directly: /portal/favicon.png 404, /favicon.png\n404, /portal/fonts/inter-regular.woff2 404. Probed the other way —\n`find antarmuka/portal -iname ''*.woff2'' -o -iname ''favicon*''` returns\nnothing, and Trunk.toml copies only assets/* and styles/*.css. These\nfiles are not missing. They have never existed. perlengkapan''s\nindex.html does none of this, so it is portal-specific.\n\nindex.html preloads three .woff2 files and declares four @font-face\nrules whose url() is one of them. The url() half always 404s. The\nlocal() half adds nothing, because body already says\n\n    font-family: ''Inter'', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, ...\n\nwhich uses an installed Inter if there is one and falls through if there\nis not. So the @font-face blocks bought failed requests and not one\npixel. Removed; rendering is unchanged.\n\nThe favicon now points at a file that exists — assets/kejaksaan-logo.png,\nrelative so it resolves through <base href=\"/portal/\"> (verified 200 on\nstaging). Absolute /favicon.png is exactly why it 404''d behind the\ningress.\n\nsrc/utils/asset_optimization.rs is deleted. It preloads /favicon.png,\n/assets/logo.png (the real file is kejaksaan-logo.png) and the same three\nfonts. init_asset_optimization() has zero callers repo-wide, so it is not\npart of today''s 404s — it is the deferred version of them, waiting for\nwhoever wires it up.\n\nIts only test was\n\n    assert!(fonts.contains(&\"/fonts/inter-regular.woff2\"));\n\nwhich certified a path that 404s. A test can hold a mistake in place\ninstead of catching it, and this one did.\n\nFollow-up, deliberately not done here: lib/ui''s FontLoadingStrategy::\napply() hard-codes the same three dead paths. After this it has no\nconsumers left, but removing a public lib-ui API does not belong in a\nportal fix — it belongs with the FE dead-code audit.\n\nVerified: cargo check -p portal-microfrontend --target\nwasm32-unknown-unknown is green after the deletion.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AUqQeBUFcU2eAw2EZwRgwn\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkUXsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAa3gQAIEz3vbLJV48xZJHQNzKThxk\n2Oi1lyWS/3Q0eQc+frPiwAnqbruQJQKEOPJ8RwrYvPlp3OQ0uGVohGHz+7Ma7o/5\nGKYS8kEVx87yzrIUl9E13SBTAA4eAatJRCJqHVPbVk8D55jad6v6RVf1KOpn6iIp\nzwvqz5+aHfsbaII5DgQFBUWpPB442ulMgPxe6HTaC3zcEdMv71hDYRtyiTos33bU\nkokpjBYfD/WYKKkDZwVdWQEQHoJCoVA4lGGJxyosUj+4Yy/tvC33j09mkHGo8Q/l\n0JDyrULUCc9UCJ8y28yaPLHdr3mEoT533Yg8aKyZKL8mp1pFFTZyvzkOmrlDKrRA\n907AaqtRpaIHfc3zKNhlqkSUlz2NAbwQ2Yq2DA9QxSrsmyFjg7c2CXmEJNHcayEk\n4EQT3GVaI0cdZZ3EyVMCgEkftZoRO94OXGbBH7emWgmYhPn0v3rf/bzgAMEgFR3r\n/oBp8dw2dSw6JIjKmdsFrTfQ7yb7Gm4kB52i/kBwP6vQ5ARHSSBIQwYtXDjd2/kB\n02vbhX8LsEkqIlC6WPGl97nnhnlwnrJns1BUQW52SOJPRGhQLCzQCnP+gcAyn338\nBmyJzx79AKRMijWSgUgLuCzC6sP+nWNKkSyh5ORHFb+zui/DKPbmMgNcBae8A8d5\nE/CNg3Mpt3JF7F8a+1pS\n=HBNh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-28T08:25:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commit/1333099a0a53760062e82995e69e5b5305e394ff","node_id":"C_kwDOP93DxNoAKDEzMzMwOTlhMGE1Mzc2MDA2MmU4Mjk5NWU2OWU1YjUzMDVlMzk0ZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commit/f68b9a7c8ee6583bb5c41aa1b34f4c8ff202f412","sha":"f68b9a7c8ee6583bb5c41aa1b34f4c8ff202f412","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commits/f68b9a7c8ee6583bb5c41aa1b34f4c8ff202f412"}],"sha":"1333099a0a53760062e82995e69e5b5305e394ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commits/1333099a0a53760062e82995e69e5b5305e394ff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220909633?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/analisaperlengkapan","id":220909633,"login":"analisaperlengkapan","node_id":"U_kgDODSrQQQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/analisaperlengkapan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commits/f68b9a7c8ee6583bb5c41aa1b34f4c8ff202f412/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T08:23:02Z","email":"analisaperlengkapan@gmail.com","name":"analisaperlengkapan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T08:23:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(perlengkapan): the pakaian dinas laporan page 400''d on every load (#854)\n\nBoth laporan tabs send `pengajuan_id` as optional. Both handlers require it:\n\n    get_laporan_rekap_ukuran   Query<LaporanRekapQuery>   pengajuan_id: Uuid\n    get_laporan_daftar_pegawai Query<LaporanDaftarQuery>  pengajuan_id: Uuid\n\nso axum rejects a request that omits it BEFORE the handler runs. Reproduced\nagainst staging with a freshly minted token, so this is not a session or\nscoping artefact:\n\n    GET /api/v1/perlengkapan/pakaian-dinas/laporan/rekap-ukuran\n      -> 400 Failed to deserialize query string: missing field `pengajuan_id`\n    GET /api/v1/perlengkapan/pakaian-dinas/laporan/daftar-pegawai\n      -> 400 Failed to deserialize query string: missing field `pengajuan_id`\n    GET ...rekap-ukuran?pengajuan_id=<real uuid>\n      -> 200\n\nThe page mounts before anything is selected, so it fired that request on every\nload and rendered an ErrorState — telling the user something broke, when in\nfact nothing had been asked for yet.\n\n`download_export` in the same file already guards on exactly this\n(`let Some(pengajuan_id) = query.pengajuan_id.clone() else { return; }`),\ncomplete with a comment explaining that the export endpoint needs it. The\nguard was won once and never carried across to the two read paths — the same\nshape as #849, where a fix that existed since F5-B had never been derived to\nits sibling site.\n\nBoth read paths now short-circuit before the request, and the empty state\ndistinguishes the two cases it used to conflate: an empty result and an\nunselected pengajuan look identical on screen but are not the same thing, so\n\"Tidak Ada Data\" becomes \"Pilih Pengajuan\" with an instruction.\n\nNo new test: `assertNoFailedApiCalls` in tests/e2e/helpers/page-load.ts already\nasserts that no API call fails while a page loads, and it is what caught this —\nit failed 8 times in the first staging run and 9 in the second. It is the\nregression test.\n\nVerified: cargo check --target wasm32-unknown-unknown is clean, and the check\nwas canaried (a deliberate type error made it fail E0308) so that a green\nresult is known to be measuring this file rather than a cached artefact.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AUqQeBUFcU2eAw2EZwRgwn\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"40120fb8e392873d07900150aef615f45ce2ef47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/git/trees/40120fb8e392873d07900150aef615f45ce2ef47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/git/commits/f68b9a7c8ee6583bb5c41aa1b34f4c8ff202f412","verification":{"payload":"tree 40120fb8e392873d07900150aef615f45ce2ef47\nparent d7b05513b01ce87a444a4edd6e589b67bb9daff3\nauthor analisaperlengkapan <analisaperlengkapan@gmail.com> 1787905382 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787905382 +0000\n\nfix(perlengkapan): the pakaian dinas laporan page 400''d on every load (#854)\n\nBoth laporan tabs send `pengajuan_id` as optional. Both handlers require it:\n\n    get_laporan_rekap_ukuran   Query<LaporanRekapQuery>   pengajuan_id: Uuid\n    get_laporan_daftar_pegawai Query<LaporanDaftarQuery>  pengajuan_id: Uuid\n\nso axum rejects a request that omits it BEFORE the handler runs. Reproduced\nagainst staging with a freshly minted token, so this is not a session or\nscoping artefact:\n\n    GET /api/v1/perlengkapan/pakaian-dinas/laporan/rekap-ukuran\n      -> 400 Failed to deserialize query string: missing field `pengajuan_id`\n    GET /api/v1/perlengkapan/pakaian-dinas/laporan/daftar-pegawai\n      -> 400 Failed to deserialize query string: missing field `pengajuan_id`\n    GET ...rekap-ukuran?pengajuan_id=<real uuid>\n      -> 200\n\nThe page mounts before anything is selected, so it fired that request on every\nload and rendered an ErrorState — telling the user something broke, when in\nfact nothing had been asked for yet.\n\n`download_export` in the same file already guards on exactly this\n(`let Some(pengajuan_id) = query.pengajuan_id.clone() else { return; }`),\ncomplete with a comment explaining that the export endpoint needs it. The\nguard was won once and never carried across to the two read paths — the same\nshape as #849, where a fix that existed since F5-B had never been derived to\nits sibling site.\n\nBoth read paths now short-circuit before the request, and the empty state\ndistinguishes the two cases it used to conflate: an empty result and an\nunselected pengajuan look identical on screen but are not the same thing, so\n\"Tidak Ada Data\" becomes \"Pilih Pengajuan\" with an instruction.\n\nNo new test: `assertNoFailedApiCalls` in tests/e2e/helpers/page-load.ts already\nasserts that no API call fails while a page loads, and it is what caught this —\nit failed 8 times in the first staging run and 9 in the second. It is the\nregression test.\n\nVerified: cargo check --target wasm32-unknown-unknown is clean, and the check\nwas canaried (a deliberate type error made it fail E0308) so that a green\nresult is known to be measuring this file rather than a cached artefact.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AUqQeBUFcU2eAw2EZwRgwn\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkUVmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqmoQAJ3EPJpaw87hVkYFopd0sYvH\ncdDwwgORQy6KBwwwkPnHaAhoKcGZztesZJRoD6R6+TLE5TQxHW4dAxXkaSod7WQX\noaG01Ch6L5FdI5KEQ40EIOAJlwlb0IzOOEKizADRRqBQY+r+kgwY/QWnGjiwlW5s\nd3Vf/mX66tv5jEOoSWuX6Y4shcqw6EHY2SdjskD/t46FvNp4oqK657ZIcS0cGaio\nfdo9jHXQUNynt3CSjOZkHCa4+DtYjkUPOFdbtHrZb4LXzKWeNcLDwnk1L1Rh72a6\nvJQxltlq5F5RqckhbTNuW8C4wQlOBugJ5AMR+sx0NpRh+Aq6okEBqI5UVbFjqVx9\nRETEICqy1KW1UvWGdjx5o4gj8V/E84hfim/rdV2XEN/63fsnisu6q/13S8WG+avk\nfPvtfudQHDHQ+VsRdNWv5rwWaFuApkqvbbTq5qyF4VJc6l0aglEb4X4zTsmEfpJS\ntom2WdXeBeoQaATMKq6Qhle1yP3P+4f1VyT9gBgfi1iqWAi1CzhN0t61T/mY+gn5\n014ADNKPh07SfBGHhwc6Et3meXRjVA6ok3sV7BXT46c48/lIgOsAStm1fraJjBuN\nUAXFqPnyXyyda9N6RjAW/XzdU/rZmNo89QtH1PISxu+1TL36fBIiDeVxX/aLqvG0\nvob4X/BsDXaBkjgZLjJe\n=8EIX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-28T08:23:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commit/f68b9a7c8ee6583bb5c41aa1b34f4c8ff202f412","node_id":"C_kwDOP93DxNoAKGY2OGI5YTdjOGVlNjU4M2JiNWM0MWFhMWIzNGY0YzhmZjIwMmY0MTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commit/d7b05513b01ce87a444a4edd6e589b67bb9daff3","sha":"d7b05513b01ce87a444a4edd6e589b67bb9daff3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commits/d7b05513b01ce87a444a4edd6e589b67bb9daff3"}],"sha":"f68b9a7c8ee6583bb5c41aa1b34f4c8ff202f412","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commits/f68b9a7c8ee6583bb5c41aa1b34f4c8ff202f412"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/analisaperlengkapan/simpel2/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=f7b040a2c8d03ce55f890d31cd7e3bc0a444aa65&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A39%3A57.109Z"}');
