rod/commit/557e55a764481c0e43d21e99063ffa94354829f1","node_id":"C_kwDOP98E2doAKDU1N2U1NWE3NjQ0ODFjMGU0M2QyMWU5OTA2M2ZmYTk0MzU0ODI5ZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/commit/99b483e7977cfd18b6687288a4f3960880740cfc","sha":"99b483e7977cfd18b6687288a4f3960880740cfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/commits/99b483e7977cfd18b6687288a4f3960880740cfc"}],"sha":"557e55a764481c0e43d21e99063ffa94354829f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/commits/557e55a764481c0e43d21e99063ffa94354829f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112887922?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PhoenixWild29","id":112887922,"login":"PhoenixWild29","node_id":"U_kgDOBrqIcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/commits/99b483e7977cfd18b6687288a4f3960880740cfc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T18:44:07Z","email":"112887922+PhoenixWild29@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Samuel J Shamber"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T18:44:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(health): wire real Celery worker ping into /health (#357)\n\n* feat(health): wire real Celery worker ping into /health\n\nReplaces the ''unknown / not implemented'' placeholder for celery_workers\nwith a real broker-side inspect().ping() check. Runs in a threadpool via\nasyncio.to_thread so the endpoint stays fast, with a strict 0.5s inspect\ntimeout and 1.0s hard wall-clock timeout.\n\nThree-way outcome:\n  - workers respond               -> healthy (with worker count + names)\n  - broker up, no worker replies  -> degraded\n  - broker unreachable / error    -> unhealthy\n\nClears the persistent overall_status=degraded flag in prod that was\ncaused by celery_workers=unknown being counted as an unchecked component.\n\n* test(health): fix stale test_health assertion for enhanced schema\n\nThe /health endpoint returns EnhancedHealthResponse (overall_status,\ncomponents, degraded_components, ...), not the legacy {\"status\": \"healthy\"}\nsingle-field shape. Assert against the actual schema contract instead.","tree":{"sha":"269f0bd96a35acf5e67dadc815db778dfc698572","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/git/trees/269f0bd96a35acf5e67dadc815db778dfc698572"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/git/commits/99b483e7977cfd18b6687288a4f3960880740cfc","verification":{"payload":"tree 269f0bd96a35acf5e67dadc815db778dfc698572\nparent fbcf0a8ed17098d1c857c5e376b1853f0e759cdf\nauthor Samuel J Shamber <112887922+PhoenixWild29@users.noreply.github.com> 1786905847 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786905847 -0400\n\nfeat(health): wire real Celery worker ping into /health (#357)\n\n* feat(health): wire real Celery worker ping into /health\n\nReplaces the ''unknown / not implemented'' placeholder for celery_workers\nwith a real broker-side inspect().ping() check. Runs in a threadpool via\nasyncio.to_thread so the endpoint stays fast, with a strict 0.5s inspect\ntimeout and 1.0s hard wall-clock timeout.\n\nThree-way outcome:\n  - workers respond               -> healthy (with worker count + names)\n  - broker up, no worker replies  -> degraded\n  - broker unreachable / error    -> unhealthy\n\nClears the persistent overall_status=degraded flag in prod that was\ncaused by celery_workers=unknown being counted as an unchecked component.\n\n* test(health): fix stale test_health assertion for enhanced schema\n\nThe /health endpoint returns EnhancedHealthResponse (overall_status,\ncomponents, degraded_components, ...), not the legacy {\"status\": \"healthy\"}\nsingle-field shape. Assert against the actual schema contract instead.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqggT3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApYIQADmqZ2j+M7UxqdIh14g+11UF\nzpIX/I9kRHsjftDtloGxiZPW31pZ427qwPB8qWy1LSvO0lpoUP8YAkwDSdui4rR4\nRrrmtxzNE7koxCBqYogYFi4vfAijskb+RKQJCRORxK1NqQycKkUU5+xxtNwL+FZG\nkM7ryasL6G5P9FnjSRNStgqmKKWyCphjwS7ag253fZ+LGRtWQC6Axj4frxdjUXGe\n7PXISCVGU29UmBymSO7mEsDAiUPtQQIHBY4kLsCevT5QcC9yXAtQH+mWksf0imev\nR7SItKeEXNVPnMG8lioMEo0BhnNgWfMiH7jxNuy6kBHyNeHBMLm9ewxNaYEeG7dW\nfPRYCIQ7D7VGZGhQZdBHUaRpI9YhWp4boQWIrEb6dPKmVXgG7Y+ZBND2LtQQeYqB\nnOnhe7fXjf/yq9IjCo3L9P5mGdIH+aLXEAR9+2UNmxp3LxzT1JPUOGZ7JkQRJWPl\nxxb/LQN0SFv8qpMZuAZuSF1OQiAMC4AMyfW5ge135K/ypzDpPpePr0dWGEjwUtIJ\n6WJ+0ayzBVfrl9L6KId+IRc/iwU9Bo3ePxGW0quxriSC2EA1XrjZFvjz1ehbGmtj\nl6hG65yfDy+MQ+vRMC2EY3qJnsRzOeDZe8jaU1dPEBgimdpmgXaWa8sQ9HVwu3cf\ndKMbvpx6RSEx1NYNXvnT\n=mSx8\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-16T18:44:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/us