ved_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/commits/960f6882fb34e7e670e0e56d302a5f95c570f40f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T12:56:02Z","email":"112887922+PhoenixWild29@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Samuel J Shamber"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T12:56:02Z","email":"112887922+PhoenixWild29@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Samuel J Shamber"},"message":"fix: token refresh grace-window race and cookie clearing bugs\n\nB1: Grace-window path no longer revokes the prior successor token,\npreventing spurious theft detection that force-logged-out multi-tab\nusers. The other tab''s token stays alive for normal rotation.\n\nB2: Failure paths in /token/refresh now return JSONResponse instead\nof raising HTTPException, so delete_cookie is actually delivered to\nthe browser (FastAPI discards cookie mutations on raised exceptions).\n\nAlso: remove dead cookie_domain config (W1), pass db session to\nget_user_by_id to avoid second pool connection per refresh (W2),\nstrip dead revocation logic from /logout endpoint (W4), add\nTOKEN_THEFT_DETECTED Prometheus counter (W6), fix test setup to\nscope SQLite table creation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d012df22c135247ff1bb7b647234a496a5cc3e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/git/trees/2d012df22c135247ff1bb7b647234a496a5cc3e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/git/commits/960f6882fb34e7e670e0e56d302a5f95c570f40f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signa