 J Shamber"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T13:09:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: user document listing with MinIO persistence and status tracking (#304)\n\n- Add UserDocument ORM model tracking uploads per user (processing_status,\n  chunk_count, error_message, celery_task_id)\n- Add Alembic migration 007 with FK to users, CHECK constraint, indexes\n- Fix critical upload bug: persist files to MinIO instead of local /tmp\n  (Celery worker runs in separate container with no shared filesystem)\n- Pre-generate Celery task_id to eliminate race condition between API\n  commit and worker status update\n- Update process_document task: download from MinIO, set status transitions\n  (pending→processing→completed/failed), handle empty-text extraction\n- Add GET /documents (user-scoped, paginated, filterable by status/search/sort)\n- Add GET /documents/{id} (user-scoped, 404 if not owned)\n- Wire DocumentsPage to new endpoint (replaces admin-only fallback)\n- Wire DocumentsWidget to handle envelope response\n- Add user_id to batch upload metadata (was missing)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"727c062552b23cead79fc7df61624a939491dace","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/git/trees/727c062552b23cead79fc7df61624a939491dace"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/git/commits/5a04249392a03f0a336cb403104e2b7f60684de4","verification":{"payload":"tree 727c062552b23cead79fc7df61624a939491dace\nparent f63cc5d0f6aa094580fe5438579fb88b8ecb0aff\nauthor Samuel J Shamber <112887922+PhoenixWild29@users.noreply.github.com> 1780319366 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780319366 -0400\n\nfeat: user document listing with MinIO persistence and status tracking (#304)\n\n- Add UserDocument ORM model tracking uploads per user (processing_status,\n  chunk_count, error_message, celery_task_id)\n- Add Alembic migration 007 with FK to users, CHECK constraint, indexes\n- Fix critical upload bug: persist files to MinIO instead of local /tmp\n  (Celery worker runs in separate container with no shared filesystem)\n- Pre-generate Celery task_id to eliminate race condition between API\n  commit and worker status update\n- Update process_document task: download from MinIO, set status transitions\n  (pending→processing→completed/failed), handle empty-text extraction\n- Add GET /documents (user-scoped, paginated, filterable by status/search/sort)\n- Add GET /documents/{id} (user-scoped, 404 if not owned)\n- Wire DocumentsPage to new endpoint (replaces admin-only fallback)\n- Wire DocumentsWidget to handle envelope response\n- Add user_id to batch upload metadata (was missing)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHYSGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwpcQAKm0C2xNbgCgQnQgUlOgMeJx\nhuGuHMWStLjgyR8Xo/4awEfpLKWbnmxNerf7u/92N04O4ri7VidCm/LIX5fHTqU9\nttwUsbq9KiQCPcEIF9FcaoJH/mArGAawOfXB9INXR0hdgZKdl0Pp+t+B1+B/yFzY\nGNXLYCNl/Zxd4BH3RY77AgXZ7OI+fAqYixH0NkBVZf9Iw02d83EoBD/Hs4sNBAmI\nmOUXRpuwPG9H2pTQM0FzRhWb9YlIj5J4u2F915SjJbJcO4/mJ7EZ1yGoa2TTnX11\n0ASRdVUHEQ1oLsp3Drf5mNkcIYVQ9nsDl2ILMYZQZ7oCei9nadUWomIsfGMTvTyT\nydr/hCupJTCB2zb62XFqNy6RG50aEAlpTqjL5wd/9CVUFKm2RZasyd1/kMKTde+y\nJtEHo6YM1x4IB2+eitPj/Ok3hE/8EkFKe/SedG3ZogE1r3aArkjNPltlGo1RfkbT\nu5/ESVoz4j3flGeEvDAATQBg5TxjEN+fDfuVHIxdA5wokMNlKgEaxZDacdliKQJm\naP8jMhSuzH2Li6TM8vMy8cfBl8V2MX27e+gI6iraX46hf79L6Rm019tYPJzctEUO\nnnI6R1NSbg1Cb9m+s7Z4nWUGM8fatK6xnuwGrkYZQOjUvBX4WEePPkBxpAl/TLoH\nYmoKLwCA0jgOZ2TZrbNx\n=Xuzc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-01T13:09:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url"