reply.github.com","name":"Samuel J Shamber"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T01:23:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: correct fastembed TextCrossEncoder import path (#302)\n\nTextCrossEncoder is not exported from fastembed''s top-level __init__.py\nin any version — it lives at fastembed.rerank.cross_encoder. The wrong\nimport path (from fastembed import TextCrossEncoder) caused the Docker\nbuild to crash on deploy, and meant the reranker was silently dead at\nruntime behind exception handlers since PR #285.\n\nFixed in both locations:\n- Dockerfile bake step (build-time)\n- app/services/reranker.py _ensure_loaded() (runtime)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b04adb075eedb1ac9b665862501e56446b516667","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/git/trees/b04adb075eedb1ac9b665862501e56446b516667"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/git/commits/0c46400e4d104f9199f5e1d74f17529b0705586d","verification":{"payload":"tree b04adb075eedb1ac9b665862501e56446b516667\nparent 992c715ee04028d215548b50d972fcd7225fbe34\nauthor Samuel J Shamber <112887922+PhoenixWild29@users.noreply.github.com> 1780190588 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780190588 -0400\n\nfix: correct fastembed TextCrossEncoder import path (#302)\n\nTextCrossEncoder is not exported from fastembed''s top-level __init__.py\nin any version — it lives at fastembed.rerank.cross_encoder. The wrong\nimport path (from fastembed import TextCrossEncoder) caused the Docker\nbuild to crash on deploy, and meant the reranker was silently dead at\nruntime behind exception handlers since PR #285.\n\nFixed in both locations:\n- Dockerfile bake step (build-time)\n- app/services/reranker.py _ensure_loaded() (runtime)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqG418CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAl9IQAA8h48QG0wJMf79g