04028d215548b50d972fcd7225fbe34","sha":"992c715ee04028d215548b50d972fcd7225fbe34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/commits/992c715ee04028d215548b50d972fcd7225fbe34"}],"sha":"0c46400e4d104f9199f5e1d74f17529b0705586d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/commits/0c46400e4d104f9199f5e1d74f17529b0705586d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112887922?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PhoenixWild29","id":112887922,"login":"PhoenixWild29","node_id":"U_kgDOBrqIcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/commits/992c715ee04028d215548b50d972fcd7225fbe34/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T20:29:47Z","email":"112887922+PhoenixWild29@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Samuel J Shamber"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T20:29:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: circuit breaker for external APIs + sentinel cleanup + rate trend tool (#300)\n\nCircuit breaker (app/services/circuit_breaker.py):\n- Custom CLOSED/OPEN/HALF_OPEN state machine, thread-safe, ~140 lines\n- Wraps OUTSIDE retry-decorated methods so open circuit short-circuits\n  before any retry/backoff and exhausted retries count as one failure\n- Per-process state (documented limitation for Celery workers)\n- Module-level registry with get_breaker() and get_all_breaker_states()\n\nIntegrations:\n- FinnhubConnector: breaker wraps all fetcher calls via _guarded_call(),\n  CircuitBreakerOpen breaks out of ticker/indicator loops gracefully\n- PerplexityClient: breaker wraps the OpenAI API call in research()\n- GoogleDriveConnector: breaker wraps file listing and content extraction,\n  saves incremental state before aborting on open circuit\n- /health endpoint: surfaces circuit breaker states as components,\n  reports \"degraded\" if any breaker is OPEN\n\nSentinel cleanup:\n- Remove dead simulate_risk() stub (bedrock not configured, hardcoded\n  sessionId=\"session-123\") and its tool registration\n- Fix ''N/A'' sentinel in get_market_quote — proper None handling\n- Add startup warnings for default JWT/CSRF secret values\n\nRate data:\n- Add DGS2/5/10/30 + DPRIME to Finnhub economic indicators (folded\n  into existing connector per CoWork W3, no new connector file)\n- Add get_rate_trend agent tool querying market_data_history with\n  graceful degradation for insufficient history (CoWork W5)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"653151649cf681bfd9089090ab2db65a93a63cd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/git/trees/653151649cf681bfd9089090ab2db65a93a63cd6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/git/commits/992c715ee04028d215548b50d972fcd7225fbe34","verification":{"payload":"tree 653151649cf681bfd9089090ab2db65a93a63cd6\nparent 54b9a8a27e0fff8f2b62458b0cd7be72cc550e43\nauthor Samuel J Shamber <112887922+PhoenixWild29@users.noreply.github.com> 1780172987 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780172987 -0400\n\nfeat: circuit breaker for external APIs + sentinel cleanup + rate trend tool (#300)\n\nCircuit breaker (app/services/circuit_breaker.py):\n- Custom CLOSED/OPEN/HALF_OPEN state machine, thread-safe, ~140 lines\n- Wraps OUTSIDE retry-decorated methods so open circuit short-circuits\n  before any retry/backoff and exhausted retries count as one failure\n- Per-process state (documented limitation for Celery workers)\n- Module-level registry with get_breaker() and get_all_breaker_states()\n\nIntegrations:\n- FinnhubConnector: breaker wraps all fetcher calls via _guarded_call(),\n  CircuitBreakerOpen breaks out of ticker/indicator loops gracefully\n- PerplexityClient: breaker wraps the OpenAI API call in research()\n- GoogleDriveConnector: breaker wraps file listing and content extraction,\n  saves incremental state before aborting on open circuit\n- /health endpoint: surfaces circuit breaker states as components,\n  reports \"degraded\" if any breaker is OPEN\n\nSentinel cleanup:\n- Remove dead simulate_risk() stub (bedrock not configured, hardcoded\n  sessionId=\"session-123\") and its tool registration\n- Fix ''N/A'' sentinel in get_market_quote — proper None handling\n- Add startup warnings for default JWT/CSRF secret values\n\nRate data:\n- Add DGS2/5/10/30 + DPRIME to Finnhub economic indicators (folded\n  into existing connector per CoWork W3, no new connector file)\n- Add get_rate_trend agent tool querying market_data_history with\n  graceful degradation for insufficient history (CoWork W5)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqG0i7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVoIQAF/Q9DdW4UZE4YIY0wwcVD46\nGse7hdapmgXnyjcyh15Tgz2AANWwP3HpF36tbeGPbcDX7wc+4U/Se7z3m6o5OPns\ngrwQqHDF+TxyPipvgTU1LcSt9JsPUu86k2EUx1x8wu8ChMviUnHwgs5PQdZG7KjF\nYQiBwKB3ccjodZNry/j+OImQFFC0T9DFgiLb5SZlc7HGSYsGDtfMz6Nh3RKvdLg9\n31yqx1lgQFLR7RzAts+9NWHwv2IFzAamyzGF6RHs/djkRC6zHwhkehesZ87Lbyzx\nZFK+PEBS6A+wl6E/jaM6l7tdP8LEqOMTwY7s2hP6PE3aOJCMCCoO0nbA7P1uY0M5\nkicfp8KprCUIivyEmt3ZbIwjF/55R9T79IWDDr2N4vlrTNCWHcEC8aapNkrUhsgz\nGt0r+BMaCS1YNcnZThzYbHXcHXe