,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PhoenixWild29","id":112887922,"login":"PhoenixWild29","node_id":"U_kgDOBrqIcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/commits/54b9a8a27e0fff8f2b62458b0cd7be72cc550e43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T18:57:56Z","email":"112887922+PhoenixWild29@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Samuel J Shamber"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T18:57:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: bake fastembed ONNX models into Docker image layer (#299)\n\nEliminates ~330MB model download on every cold start by pre-caching\nboth the embedder (bge-small-en-v1.5) and reranker (bge-reranker-base)\nONNX models during docker build. All 5 fastembed instantiation sites\nnow pass cache_dir=settings.fastembed_cache_dir so runtime loads from\nthe baked layer. Dockerfile cleaned up: --no-cache-dir on pip install,\nstale HuggingFace/sentence-transformers comments removed, ENV\nFASTEMBED_CACHE_PATH set as backstop. Health check start_period reduced\nfrom 600s/180s to 300s/90s (compose/Dockerfile) since models are\npre-cached.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"daaf4516d2f4c89edd0fe6fd27d366fc10ca5e1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/git/trees/daaf4516d2f4c89edd0fe6fd27d366fc10ca5e1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/git/commits/54b9a8a27e0fff8f2b62458b0cd7be72cc550e43","verification":{"payload":"tree daaf4516d2f4c89edd0fe6fd27d366fc10ca5e1f\nparent 56b854171de01c942a5c1404fdfbea85ee4c85c7\nauthor Samuel J Shamber <112887922+PhoenixWild29@users.noreply.github.com> 1780167476 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780167476 -0400\n\nfeat: bake fastembed ONNX models into Docker image layer (#299)\n\nEliminates ~330MB model download on every cold start by pre-caching\nboth the embedder (bge-small-en-v1.5) and reranker (bge-reranker-base)\nONNX models during docker build. All 5 fastembed instantiation sites\nnow pass cache_dir=settings.fastembed_cache_dir so runtime loads from\nthe baked layer. Dockerfile cleaned up: --no-cache-dir on pip install,\nstale HuggingFace/sentence-transformers comments removed, ENV\nFASTEMBED_CACHE_PATH set as backstop. Health check start_period reduced\nfrom 600s/180s to 300s/90s (compose/Dockerfile) since models are\npre-cached.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqGzM0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJooQAI5bZ54p7jcyHy6TgX7eCBRn\n46HQ9wEQcN8m+JpDI5nKCZrR4+w7Y/UY+If8KvZii8xZGWIBWp316Io6FbiRc0Qd\nQF3Xn75xtQkq4Xa6cfnX+1Qf7rgtJABgHTyr7orA5CXyRocX6lyBBwtgINOKMRPP\n5yoFTroYXlUpGQPh+2LPpr2vmFYsERaSGNanR0GcqKY+RCCf7Xgnnsq8XfJnw29u\nkiyDBNUAvfk4PLQ7QlAD7w9ito2opwL0pgomUC69X/cPXCvSB87iPGgNYxTGDWct\nT1YpX/E9IsaFvwx+x4lHvcvG4P+MrBIRty2SNVvrD7v350L0GQ9X7ejfh2R4NfiW\nuE56htSHtGf6o9Wqher+R1GNtASP3BcmqeZ8vPmY0sELhuQergHMhdOqbDRtwAwk\nbWmISpXiA+oFryHE3X1s/5kujD42bnPRSQOjxhEKQOYE7W5u7f/oWqA7nLa/+Hvc\nTOg4sw6rObAOB11ssV368gmROB1nDdnvk2GgaBi5OTtI/Eu9DUSBGgwV5DOVYttc\nS+q7CPN5FIfjAqUjYiYzArAxiH+MGoU6mbIQG2ATUbJIY6lxSjFRtIYJphVaCEkQ\n2uTUhYWmOPW37hWEsPt+2Mmpc5kb