-L6-v2 → fastembed/bge-small-en-v1.5\n- LLM: local Llama-3-8B via transformers → OpenAI GPT-4o via langchain-openai\n- Auth: jose → PyJWT (already fixed in code, templates lagged)\n- datetime: utcnow() → datetime.now(timezone.utc) across all docs\n- FastAPI version: 0.112.0 → 0.136.3\n- Bias detection: AIF360 code → actual stub (returns 0.0)\n- Reranker: added to Phase 1 RAG pipeline description\n- SageMaker/MLflow: annotated as applicable if/when self-hosted\n- Line number references: replaced with function names (more stable)\n- SQLAlchemy column defaults: use lambda callable, not direct call (B1)\n- Swept utcnow() in non-template docs too (S2): security-best-practices,\n  api-integration-patterns, observability, adrs/001-celery-vs-rq\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb68224b8240669dc5c3f0e3f991167a640453c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/git/trees/bb68224b8240669dc5c3f0e3f991167a640453c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/git/commits/60ac956311a6e5f614d73115c7776358a2fe8871","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112887922?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PhoenixWild29","id":112887922,"login":"PhoenixWild29","node_id":"U_kgDOBrqIcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild2