":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/commits/148267d9d8f9a9eccb6810bcf0ff2e53de3e14ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T15:10:12Z","email":"112887922+PhoenixWild29@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Samuel J Shamber"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T15:10:12Z","email":"112887922+PhoenixWild29@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Samuel J Shamber"},"message":"feat: add retrieval eval framework — synthetic eval set, metrics, chunk A/B\n\nBuilds the measurement infrastructure for eval-driven ML decisions\n(Priority 2 roadmap). Three scripts that test retrieval quality in\nisolation, without LLM calls:\n\n1. scripts/generate_retrieval_eval.py — GPT-4o generates synthetic\n   query-doc pairs from seed corpus with colloquial phrasing (CoWork S1:\n   avoids lexical echo bias). Includes answer_span for chunk-precision\n   measurement (CoWork S2).\n\n2. tests/eval_retrieval.py — Retrieval eval harness measuring MRR@5,\n   Recall@5, NDCG@5, and span containment. Bootstrap 95% CIs on all\n   metrics (CoWork S3). Local mode (direct FAISS access). Compare flag\n   for diffing two runs.\n\n3. scripts/eval_chunk_sizes.py — A/B test orchestrator that rechunks\n   seed data at 128/192/256 tokens, builds temp FAISS indexes, and\n   compares retrieval metrics. Winner determination requires separated\n   CIs, not just raw deltas.\n\nNext: generate eval set, run baseline, then implement reranker (Sprint 4)\nwith B1 fix (normalize reranker logits via sigmoid before freshness\nmultiplication).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"feb0d77f4b8641556fb84142879fa38f3ad1118e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/git/trees/feb0d77f4b86415