,"gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PhoenixWild29","id":112887922,"login":"PhoenixWild29","node_id":"U_kgDOBrqIcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/commits/672e6694fc7c1cb00f596f641cfdec744c4c4172/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T12:35:24Z","email":"112887922+PhoenixWild29@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Samuel J Shamber"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T12:35:24Z","email":"112887922+PhoenixWild29@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Samuel J Shamber"},"message":"fix: broken alembic chain + deploy diagnostics + CI migration validation\n\nMigration 006 referenced down_revision \"005_create_conversations_tables\"\nbut migration 005''s actual revision is \"005_conversations\". Alembic can''t\nresolve the graph, crashes the container in 2-6 seconds on every deploy\nsince PR #279 merged.\n\n- Fix 006 down_revision to match 005''s actual revision ID\n- Add CI job that validates migration chain AND runs upgrade head against\n  a disposable Postgres (catches both graph breaks and execution errors)\n- Add deploy failure diagnostics step (if: failure) that captures container\n  logs, postgres logs, and alembic_version — the current workflow loses all\n  diagnostic output when the deploy step fails\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"abda466d041b80cb34621cb117f3415e69135d6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/git/trees/abda466d041b80cb34621cb117f3415e6913