ers/PhoenixWild29","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/commits/019ab6c7965ab235f71d278aad4ac7f0f730548d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T00:17:12Z","email":"112887922+PhoenixWild29@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Samuel J Shamber"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T00:17:12Z","email":"112887922+PhoenixWild29@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Samuel J Shamber"},"message":"feat: replace dashboard demo data with real market data API\n\nReplace hardcoded dashboard widgets with live Finnhub market data.\n\nBackend:\n- New /market/ API router (quotes, economic-indicators, dashboard-summary, history, latest-insight)\n- market_service.py service layer with staleness detection (quotes >2h, indicators >48h)\n- market_data_history table (migration 006) with daily snapshots via Celery Beat\n- Snapshot task chained after 6 AM Finnhub fetch (runs at 7 AM UTC)\n- Unique constraint includes unit column for correct fundamental metric snapshots\n\nFrontend:\n- KPIRow: real S&P 500, Fed Funds Rate, 30Y Mortgage, Unemployment from /market/dashboard-summary\n- MarketIndexWidget: real chart data from /market/history, graceful \"accumulating\" state\n- EconomicOverviewWidget replaces AssetAllocationWidget (no portfolio data exists)\n- AdvisorInsightWidget: real last-conversation preview from /market/latest-insight\n- Staleness badges (\"Delayed\" / \"Stale\") per CoWork review\n- Widget ID migration: asset-allocation → economic-overview in legacy aliases\n- Loading skeletons and empty states for all widgets\n\nTests:\n- 7 new tests: staleness logic, all Pydantic schemas, ORM model constraints\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7150d1e5ea279d81b3355a21204092f940fa4e94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/git/trees/7150d1e5ea279d81b3355a21204092f940fa4e94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/git/commits/019ab6c