","name":"Samuel J Shamber"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T20:24:05Z","email":"112887922+PhoenixWild29@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Samuel J Shamber"},"message":"fix: allow $0 in queries + add Perplexity regression tests\n\nAmount validator rejected $0 (\"How do I get to $0 debt?\") because the\ncheck was `<= 0` instead of `< 0`. $0 is a valid amount in financial\nquestions about debt payoff.\n\nAdds 7 new tests:\n- $0 amount acceptance and bounds validation\n- Perplexity researcher: disabled skip, high-confidence skip, low-confidence\n  augmentation, API error graceful fallback, content filter rejection\n\nCloses the zero-test-coverage gap on the Perplexity realtime code path\nthat let the hashlib import bug ship to production.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38f4182048b9f6800af8b0ac9524850d6598addf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/git/trees/38f4182048b9f6800af8b0ac9524850d6598addf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhoenixWild29/APFA-Prod/git/commits/a2253a41938ca46018783bb619ebe26b3cca5617","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112887922?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PhoenixWild29","id":112887922,"login":"PhoenixWild29","node_id":"U_kgDOBrqIcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoenixWild29/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/u