cument the Module Federation runtime-config and CORS gotchas for remote apps\n\nBoth docs described window.__APP_ENV__ injection and BFF CORS_ORIGINS\nas if a single mechanism applies uniformly to every FE app. It\ndoesn''t: for apps loaded as Module Federation remotes (not navigated\nto directly), index.html — and the <script src=\"/runtime-config.js\">\ntag in it — never loads, and the browser''s Origin header on a fetch\nalways reflects the shell''s origin, never the remote''s own. Both traps\nwere just hit and fixed in rtf-manuell-fe, bekraftabeslut-fe,\ntemplate-micro-fe and rimfrost-kubernetes.\n\ndeployment/README.md is what another team follows to stand up their\nown copy of these images; micro-fe/README.md is what someone follows\nto bootstrap a new regel micro-frontend from the template. Leaving\neither undocumented means the next remote app — ours or theirs —\nreproduces the same bug.","tree":{"sha":"29b74254583d5cd32d53a69b7744298038a8b1a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost/git/trees/29b74254583d5cd32d53a69b7744298038a8b1a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost/git/commits/4d515f730077916c220ecf90e464641c9129c506","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/242170731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LisaWedin-Ductus","id":242170731,"login":"LisaWedin-Ductus","node_id":"U_kgDODm87aw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost/commit/4d515f730077916c220ecf90e464641c9129c506","node_id":"C_kwDOP-mMj9oAKDRkNTE1ZjczMDA3NzkxNmMyMjBlY2Y5MGU0NjQ2NDFjOTEyOWM1MDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost/commit/563454911b8451f0fea25516caf6e1b2ff4fa707","sha":"563454911b8451f0fea25516caf6e1b2ff4fa707","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost/commits/563454911b8451f0fea25516caf6e1b2ff4fa707"}],"sha":"4d515f730077916c220ecf90e464641c9129c506","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost/commits/4d515f730077916c220ecf90e464641c9129c506"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/242170731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LisaWedin-Ductus","id":242170731,"login":"LisaWedin-Ductus","node_id":"U_kgDODm87aw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost/commits/563454911b8451f0fea25516caf6e1b2ff4fa707/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T10:56:06Z","email":"lisa.wedin@ductus.se","name":"LisaWedin_Ductus"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T10:56:06Z","email":"lisa.wedin@ductus.se","name":"LisaWedin_Ductus"},"message":"Document port/CORS configurability for teams deploying our images\n\nClarify that BFF ports are override-able via QUARKUS_HTTP_PORT (just\nunused today), that FE ports need an image-level mechanism to become\nconfigurable, and add CORS_ALLOW_CREDENTIALS guidance for teams running\ntheir own cookie/session-based auth.","tree":{"sha":"67b1492ffaadbe6ee30fe64db01f4a3919ff64a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost/git/trees/67b1492ffaadbe6ee30fe64db01f4a3919ff64a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost/git/commits/563454911b8451f0fea25516caf6e1b2ff4fa707","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/242170731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LisaWedin-Ductus","id":242170731,"login":"LisaWedin-Ductus","node_id":"U_kgDODm87aw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost/commit/563454911b8451f0fea25516caf6e1b2ff4fa707","node_id":"C_kwDOP-mMj9oAKDU2MzQ1NDkxMWI4NDUxZjBmZWEyNTUxNmNhZjZlMWIyZmY0ZmE3MDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost/commit/87726ff8fa8a3791471c79187c089586187f2c0b","sha":"87726ff8fa8a3791471c79187c089586187f2c0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost/commits/87726ff8fa8a3791471c79187c089586187f2c0b"}],"sha":"563454911b8451f0fea25516caf6e1b2ff4fa707","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost/commits/563454911b8451f0fea25516caf6e1b2ff4fa707"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/242170731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LisaWedin-Ductus","id":242170731,"login":"LisaWedin-Ductus","node_id":"U_kgDODm87aw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost/commits/87726ff8fa8a3791471c79187c089586187f2c0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T09:53:06Z","email":"lisa.wedin@ductus.se","name":"LisaWedin_Ductus"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T09:53:06Z","email":"lisa.wedin@ductus.se","name":"LisaWedin_Ductus"},"message":"docs: document per-app runtime-config namespacing, remotes.json override, and CORS gap\n\nenv.ts in every FE app now reads a namespaced window global\n(window.__APP_NAME_ENV__) instead of a shared window._env_, since\nModule Federation loads the portal shell and its remotes into one\nbrowser window — a shared global let one app''s runtime config leak\ninto another''s. Documents that, plus two related gaps found while\ngetting the FE/BFF stack working end-to-end in a real Kubernetes\ncluster: the bundled remotes.json only has placeholder prodEntry\nURLs (documents the PORTAL_REMOTES_CONFIG_PATH override), and the\nmicro-fe template''s Apache config sends no CORS headers, which\nbreaks cross-origin loading by the shell.","tree":{"sha":"6fe0ece3e1b10bfd8b0b72b0e4e8a733838a142c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost/git/trees/6fe0ece3e1b10bfd8b0b72b0e4e8a733838a142c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost/git/commits/87726ff8fa8a3791471c79187c089586187f2c0b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/242170731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LisaWedin-Ductus","id":242170731,"login":"LisaWedin-Ductus","node_id":"U_kgDODm87aw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/received_events","repos_url":"htt