ButtonComponent)\n- Card: Triple alias exports (Card/PetCard/CardComponent)\n- Input: Triple alias exports (Input/PetInput/InputComponent)\n- Navigation: Triple alias exports + NavigationItem type export fix\n\n PACKAGE.JSON ENHANCEMENTS:\n- Secondary entry points: @pet-design-system/ui/button\n- Professional metadata with keywords and repository info\n- Comprehensive exports configuration for all import patterns\n- Consumer-friendly postinstall message\n\n THEMING DOCUMENTATION ADDED:\n- Complete theming guide with all 170+ design tokens\n- Dark/light mode support with CSS custom properties\n- Dynamic theme switching examples with TypeScript\n- Responsive design token patterns\n- Component-specific theming examples\n\n CONSUMER EXPERIENCE:\n- Real-world examples: ecommerce-simple.ts, contact-form.ts\n- Quick start guide with 30-second setup\n- Build optimization scripts for automated distribution\n- Bundle size comparison table showing 87% reduction\n\n BUILD OPTIMIZATIONS:\n- Tree shaking enabled with sideEffects: false\n- Automated frictionless distribution script\n- Installation test verification\n- Bundle size reporting (12KB vs 88KB comparison)\n\nBreaking: No breaking changes - fully backward compatible\nMigration: Existing imports continue to work unchanged\nBenefits: 87% smaller bundles, 30-second setup, Angular Material DX\n\nResolves architect feedback about exposing optimized code like Angular Material\nEnables frictionless adoption with zero configuration required","tree":{"sha":"c5fab7e29097323e6f436a9979e413bf50a83a19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekchaturved013/pet-design-system/git/trees/c5fab7e29097323e6f436a9979e413bf50a83a19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekchaturved013/pet-design-system/git/commits/9fd1478239fc2186a1f543bb90f15e4a5167c56c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235090918?v=4","