7Z","email":"visalrajapakse@gmail.com","name":"v15a1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T06:53:17Z","email":"visalrajapakse@gmail.com","name":"v15a1"},"message":"Scope the FCM token delete to its owner and sandbox micro-app storage\n\nBackend:\n- deleteFcmTokenQuery now matches on the owning user as well as the token\n  value, so a caller who knows a token can no longer unregister someone\n  else''s device. device_token.user_id is the integer user_config.id rather\n  than the UUID, so the predicate reuses the same subquery addFcmTokenQuery\n  already uses. deleteFcmToken and its one caller pass the UUID through.\n\nFrontend:\n- Namespace every micro-app storage key by app id and reserve the secure_\n  prefix the host auth keys use, so a micro-app can no longer read or\n  overwrite the host''s refresh token or another micro-app''s entries.\n- Gate WebView navigation and bridge messages on the micro-app''s own origin,\n  and narrow allowingReadAccessToURL from file:/// to the bundle directory.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"115470ff677163a14b2cc6c68e0845bde6a33ffb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/trees/115470ff677163a14b2cc6c68e0845bde6a33ffb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/commits/4bc65d6d15391acba5c98d344d6c73c899d07791","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46480892?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/v15a1","id":46480892,"login":"v15a1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDgwODky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.co