165d4ce50"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46480892?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/v15a1","id":46480892,"login":"v15a1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDgwODky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/088c578d509e92d60c011aa797925715ce964268/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T08:07:53Z","email":"visalrajapakse@gmail.com","name":"v15a1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T08:07:53Z","email":"visalrajapakse@gmail.com","name":"v15a1"},"message":"[Backend] Fix: Authenticate wallet-pass calls with the caller''s access token\n\nThe wallet service authenticates on `Authorization` alone. It ignores\n`x-jwt-assertion` and rejects an application (client credentials) token, so\nforwarding only the assertion made every pass request fail with the gateway''s\n`900901 Invalid Credentials`, surfaced to the app as a blanket 500.\n\nHosted this cannot work at all: the API gateway overwrites `x-jwt-assertion`\nwith a JWT it mints itself, so that header never carries a token another\ngateway-fronted API will accept. The caller''s real access token is read from\n`x-user-assertion` instead, which the gateway passes through untouched and\nwhich the chat agent already relies on for the same reason.\n\n- authorization: `getUserAccessToken()` resolves the token from\n  `x-user-assertion`, then `Authorization: Bearer`, then `x-jwt-assertion`\n  (local development, where no gateway has rewritten it).\n- wallet: send the token as `Authorization: Bearer`, and keep the upstream\n  response as an `http:Response` so a failure retains its status code and body.\n  Binding to a payload type discarded both, which is what made these 500s\n  undiagnosable. Debug logs added around the call.\n- service/utils: map a wallet failure to 401 when the token was rejected and\n  502 when the wallet service failed on our behalf, instead of one opaque 500.\n\nVerified against the staging wallet service: all three token sources return a\nvalid .pkpass, and a rejected token now returns 401 with the upstream reason\nlogged.\n\nThe app-side change that sends `x-user-assertion` is left to a separate PR;\nuntil it ships, this path depends on the gateway forwarding `Authorization`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"83342c794c97c258b9c30eeb67ef1c2a727726c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/trees/83342c794c97c258b9c30eeb67ef1c2a727726c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/commits/088c578d509e92d60c011aa797925715ce964268","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46480892?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/v15a1","id":46480892,"login":"v15a1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDgwODky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/orgs","received_eve