TMAJmoELs8pb\n=NEr+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-28T15:13:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commit/9d084817217565a4c6e7f9a267ebb5d48253751b","node_id":"C_kwDOP_DE69oAKDlkMDg0ODE3MjE3NTY1YTRjNmU3ZjlhMjY3ZWJiNWQ0ODI1Mzc1MWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commit/ffc2f9fc4712a4f120555759fccb6df2efd0d5d1","sha":"ffc2f9fc4712a4f120555759fccb6df2efd0d5d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/ffc2f9fc4712a4f120555759fccb6df2efd0d5d1"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commit/c229ea6e40291dbeb54a33e634cdb8079d4884d9","sha":"c229ea6e40291dbeb54a33e634cdb8079d4884d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/c229ea6e40291dbeb54a33e634cdb8079d4884d9"}],"sha":"9d084817217565a4c6e7f9a267ebb5d48253751b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/9d084817217565a4c6e7f9a267ebb5d48253751b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46480892?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/v15a1","id":46480892,"login":"v15a1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDgwODky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/c229ea6e40291dbeb54a33e634cdb8079d4884d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T15:15:02Z","email":"visalrajapakse@gmail.com","name":"v15a1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:19:11Z","email":"shayanmalinda@gmail.com","name":"Shayan Malinda"},"message":"[Backend] Feature: Proxy wallet-pass requests to the wallet service\n\nAdd the two resources the app calls to install its business card, and the\nwallet-service client behind them:\n\n- `GET /business-card/pkpass` streams the signed `.pkpass` bytes back with\n  `application/vnd.apple.pkpass`, an attachment `Content-Disposition` and\n  `Cache-Control: no-store`.\n- `GET /business-card/google-save-url` forwards the `saveUrl` JSON.\n- A new `wallet` module holding the client, the request/response contract and\n  the two calls. The wallet service keys a pass by `serialNumber`, so\n  `WalletCardRequest` renames `userId` on the way out.\n\nThis inverts the direction of the integration. The app now talks only to the\nbackend; the backend resolves the card from the caller''s own token claims and\npushes the fields to the wallet service, instead of the wallet service pulling\nthem back through an internal endpoint. Nothing calls into Ballerina from the\nwallet service any more.\n\nThat removes the reason the previous approach needed a second, uninterceptable\nservice on an extracted `mainListener`: both resources live inside the existing\n`http:InterceptableService`, so they get `JwtInterceptor` and `userInfo` for\nfree, and the listener stays inline. The caller''s own `x-jwt-assertion` is\nforwarded per request, so the client carries no credentials of its own.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8483a5ecbeb7c3064f5b6b53a4318224f35aa166","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/trees/8483a5ecbeb7c3064f5b6b53a4318224f35aa166"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/commits/c229ea6e40291dbeb54a33e634cdb8079d4884d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43124765?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shayanmalinda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shayanmalinda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shayanmalinda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shayanmalinda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shayanmalinda","id":43124765,"login":"shayanmalinda","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMTI0NzY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shayanmalinda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shayanmalinda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shayanmalinda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shayanmalinda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shayanmalinda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"ht