":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/v15a1","id":46480892,"login":"v15a1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDgwODky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/d06c72011411e8cf023c9912c455529bcf57c817/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T15:10:11Z","email":"visalrajapakse@gmail.com","name":"v15a1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T13:13:06Z","email":"46480892+v15a1@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Visal Rajapakse"},"message":"[Backend] Feature: Derive the business card from access-token claims\n\nAdd the shared business-card type and the mapper that fills it from the\ncaller''s token claims, now that the interceptor surfaces them.\n\n- `BusinessCard`, the card field set. `department` and `location` are out of\n  scope for now, and `workPhone` was always hardcoded nil, so none of the three\n  appear.\n- `toBusinessCard`, which maps `authorization:CustomJwtPayload` to the card.\n  The wallet pass contract requires non-null names, so an absent `given_name`\n  or `family_name` becomes an empty string rather than nil.\n- `toFullResolutionPhotoUrl`, which drops the trailing `=s<pixels>` sizing\n  suffix Google appends to the `profile` claim URL, so the pass renders the\n  full resolution image.\n\nNo HTTP resource is added here. A server endpoint that re-derives the card from\nthe same token the app already holds — and already derives from, in\n`frontend/utils/businessCard.ts` — earns nothing. This layer is just the type\nand the mapper, consumed in-process by the wallet proxy above it.\n\nThere is no HR round-trip left, so there is nothing to cache either: the\nprevious `businessCardInfoCache` and `getBusinessCardInfo` are not carried over.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9617d6b7568d3af9deae88b011f2577b8ef96a82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/trees/9617d6b7568d3af9deae88b011f2577b8ef96a82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/commits/d06c72011411e8cf023c9912c455529bcf57c817","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46480892?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/v15a1","id":46480892,"login":"v15a1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDgwODky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/v15a1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commit/d06c72011411e8cf023c9912c455529bcf57c817","node_id":"C_kwDOP_DE69oAKGQwNmM3MjAxMTQxMWU4Y2YwMjNjOTkxMmM0NTU1MjliY2Y1N2M4MTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commit/7bdff50f44bf18dc07739fb31ab74a4450df7a81","sha":"7bdff50f44bf18dc07739fb31ab74a4450df7a81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensupe