1Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"message":"Update frontend package.json: deps, engines, scripts\n\nBump Node engine to >=20.19.0, add iOS build/update scripts, and update many dependencies and devDependencies to align with newer Expo/React Native toolchains. Key changes: upgrade Expo to ~54, React to 19.1.0, React Native to 0.81.5, update firebase packages, navigation, vector-icons, lottie, webview, and other expo modules; remove some obsolete packages and adjust devDeps (eslint-config-expo, jest-expo, types, etc.). These changes enable local iOS builds/updates and modernize the project dependencies.","tree":{"sha":"1db4e0c93122379c6c37db5a3d87b3016dd6d25d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/trees/1db4e0c93122379c6c37db5a3d87b3016dd6d25d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/commits/ba1d733928cffb8b0c1ca8024a9c954fed16cd1b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162027037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dileepapeiris","id":162027037,"login":"dileepapeiris","node_id":"U_kgDOCahWHQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/use