://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/8c804e24c1d827e12517d2fb7e8f956cf26b1fd6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T03:27:35Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T03:27:35Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"message":"Add user message context menu & edit modal\n\nIntroduce a tooltip-style UserMessageContextMenu and long-press handling in ChatMessageRow to allow editing/copying user messages. Replace the small edit dialog with a full-screen, safe-area-aware EditMessageModal (keyboard-avoiding, send button, max length constant) and wire an onEdit prop. Improve accessibility labels across chat components and add copy buttons accessibility to assistant message content. Fix ChatSessionDrawer mount/animation logic and refine labels for search/close/pinned items. In hooks/services: handle aborted requests by checking AbortError instead of axios cancellation, and make message ordering deterministic by adding rowid to ORDER BY in chatDatabase. Also adjust a chat suggestion label/prompt.","tree":{"sha":"71dac4c78a8bc7f26275fbd6049d44e24a06c689","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/trees/71dac4c78a8bc7f26275fbd6049d44e24a06c689"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/commits/8c804e24c1d827e12517d2fb7e8f956cf26b1fd6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162027037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/follo