","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"message":"Specify Bearer token in README diagram\n\nUpdate frontend/README.md sequence diagram: change ''GET /menu (x-jwt-assertion)'' to ''GET /menu (Bearer token)'' to more accurately reflect the token type used in the request and improve clarity.","tree":{"sha":"77649ce6d4dd9ce7f1752811ec67f2dfb991301e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/trees/77649ce6d4dd9ce7f1752811ec67f2dfb991301e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/commits/7317744dc6d4512f8f2200176a52331e68953cef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162027037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dileepapeiris","id":162027037,"login":"dileepapeiris","node_id":"U_kgDOCahWHQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commit/7317744dc6d4512f8f2200176a52331e68953cef","node_id":"C_kwDOP_DE69oAKDczMTc3NDRkYzZkNDUxMmY4ZjIyMDAxNzZhNTIzMzFlNjg5NTNjZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commit/905c0b68b15aaf35e3d7c30d0e83f95f3a6a25fd","sha":"905c0b68b15aaf35e3d7c30d0e83f95f3a6a25fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/905c0b68b15aaf35e3d7c30d0e83f95f3a6a25fd"}],"sha":"7317744dc6d4512f8f2200176a52331e68953cef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/7317744dc6d4512f8f2200176a52331e68953cef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162027037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dileepapeiris","id":162027037,"login":"dileepapeiris","node_id":"U_kgDOCahWHQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/905c0b68b15aaf35e3d7c30d0e83f95f3a6a25fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T02:57:06Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T02:57:06Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"message":"Refactor chat DB to user-scoped singleton\n\nRework chat database service into a ChatDatabase singleton class and add per-user scoping. Schema migrations now add a user_id column and index on chat_sessions if missing. Procedural DB functions (create/list/get/update/delete/touch sessions, message CRUD and truncation) now delegate to the singleton instance; setChatUserId was added to set the active user context. Also added utils/resolveChatUserId.ts to derive the chat owner id from auth state or an access token (using jwt-decode). This change centralizes DB lifecycle, enforces user scoping, and keeps backward-compatible exported helpers that forward to the new class.","tree":{"sha":"7986072381c996cd715a84940ae7e621d2c9f8ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/trees/7986072381c996cd715a84940ae7e621d2c9f8ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/commits/905c0b68b15aaf35e3d7c30d0e83f95f3a6a25fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162027037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dileepapeiris","id":162027037,"login":"dileepapeiris","node_id":"U_kgDOCahWHQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commit/905c0b68b15aaf35e3d7c30d0e83f95f3a6a25fd","node_id":"C_kwDOP_DE69oAKDkwNWMwYjY4YjE1YWFmMzVlM2Q3YzMwZDBlODNmOTVmM2E2YTI1ZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commit/c7b4add4dfb6da820785526753a971e28a4c4ae9","sha":"c7b4add4dfb6da820785526753a971e28a4c4ae9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/c7b4add4dfb6da820785526753a971e28a4c4ae9"}],"sha":"905c0b68b15aaf35e3d7c30d0e83f95f3a6a25fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/905c0b68b15aaf35e3d7c30d0e83f95f3a6a25fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162027037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dileepapeiris","id":162027037,"login":"dileepapeiris","node_id":"U_kgDOCahWHQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/c7b4add4dfb6da820785526753a971e28a4c4ae9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T02:56:41Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T02:56:41Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"message":"Remove x-jwt-assertion header from chat requests\n\nRemove the redundant \"x-jwt-assertion\" header from sendChatMessage requests in chatService.ts. The request already se