/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/cd7682a6cc76b0637d3bc4f176c71414466de110/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T22:25:41Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T22:25:41Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"message":"Refactor chat screen and extract assistant content\n\nRefactor chat screen to use composable components and hooks. Replaces inline rendering/markdown/copy logic with new components (ChatHeader, ChatComposer, ChatMessageRow, ChatEmptyState, ChatSessionDrawer, EditMessageModal) and integrates useChat/useChatSessions hooks for session and message management. Adds AssistantMessageContent component to encapsulate assistant markdown + copyable value chips. Improves theming with getChatTheme, keyboard/scroll handling, snackbar behavior, clipboard handlers, loading state, and navigation/header options. Removes legacy sendChatMessage/inline assistant parsing and consolidates message actions (regenerate, copy, edit) through the new component structure.","tree":{"sha":"d5d64e5528a1d98a40d339a3b0f69230009f07d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/trees/d5d64e5528a1d98a40d339a3b0f69230009f07d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/commits/cd7682a6cc76b0637d3bc4f176c71414466de110","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162027037?v=4","events_url":"https://api