apeiris","node_id":"U_kgDOCahWHQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/e7c2125c53da9db8a687660553865dc8fc47220b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T22:25:26Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T22:25:26Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"message":"Add ChatEmptyState and ChatHeader components\n\nAdd two new chat UI components: ChatEmptyState and ChatHeader.\n\nChatEmptyState: renders the empty chat view with greeting, headline, hint and quick-action suggestion chips. Uses ChatSuggestionChip, SuperAppAgentIcon and getChatEmptyTitleContent; accepts theme, firstName, onSuggestionPress and suggestionsDisabled props and includes responsive styling.\n\nChatHeader: top chat bar with a history/menu button (ChatMenuButton). Respects safe area insets, applies theme background and exposes onOpenHistory handler. Both files import project constants and theme types.","tree":{"sha":"4721b653faefaec018743b4e1dc374d39d474d62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/trees/4721b653faefaec018743b4e1dc374d39d474d62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/commits/e7c2125c53da9db8a687660553865dc8fc47220b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16202703