","id":162027037,"login":"dileepapeiris","node_id":"U_kgDOCahWHQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/2901f1389e9679e0e5e1a0b00736e88e050c1378/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T22:25:17Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T22:25:17Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"message":"Add ChatSuggestionChip and useChat hook\n\nIntroduce a reusable ChatSuggestionChip component for tappable suggestion chips (theming, accessibility, disabled state) and styles. Add a useChat hook to manage a single chat session: load/list messages, insert/update/truncate messages, derive session titles, and orchestrate agent turns (send, stop, retry, edit) with abort handling and error state. The hook integrates with chatDatabase and chatService, handles streaming/sent/error statuses, and exposes sendMessage, stopGeneration, retryMessage, editMessage, and refreshMessages for UI consumption.","tree":{"sha":"e58e305757becae67192d88f3ce98faa89ca862f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/trees/e58e305757becae67192d88f3ce98faa89ca862f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/commits/2901f1389e9679e0e5e1a0b00736e88e050c1378","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.c