tions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/6a4f9c66210acbea5c3cca0ecd20275c82899d69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T22:24:42Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T22:24:42Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"message":"Improve chatService request handling and validation\n\nRefactor chatService.ts to improve typing, history handling, and request robustness.\n\n- Import chat-related types and MessageStatus; remove local ChatMessage interface.\n- Add getValidAccessToken JSDoc and early-return formatting for clarity.\n- Add buildHistoryPayload to build/truncate history items for the chat-agent API.\n- Change sendChatMessage to accept SendMessageParams (message, history, signal).\n- Trim and validate message content and enforce MAX_MESSAGE_LENGTH.\n- Increase request timeout to 120s and attach external abort signal to internal controller.\n- Send token in both x-jwt-assertion and x-user-assertion headers.\n- Use trimmed message in request body and pass history directly.\n- Improve error/abort handling: rethrow AbortError, and clear timeout/remove event listener in finally.","tree":{"sha":"003e571f43b5b3deb8f760571e76b35f88a9be39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/trees/003e571f43b5b3deb8f760571e76b35f88a9be39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/commits/6a4f9c66210acbea5c3cca0ecd20275c82899d69","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162027037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api