"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/c3eb4fca8be74ad1044aef3767939c68e1efccdb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T22:22:44Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T22:22:44Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"message":"Add chat enums for roles, status, suggestions\n\nIntroduce a new Chat.ts file exporting enums to centralize chat-related constants used by the frontend: ChatRole, MessageStatus, ChatSuggestionCategory, and ChatSessionAction. Includes Apache 2.0 license header and provides named values for user/assistant roles, message lifecycle states, suggestion categories (meals, wifi, leave), and session actions (rename, pin/unpin, delete, cancel).","tree":{"sha":"ee48f9caffa37bd2ebfb293aeda0e47198ba4fd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/trees/ee48f9caffa37bd2ebfb293aeda0e47198ba4fd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/commits/c3eb4fca8be74ad1044aef3767939c68e1efccdb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162027037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dileepapeiris","id":162027037,"login":"dileepapeiris","node_id":"U_kgDOCahWHQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.