or":{"date":"2026-05-25T22:21:50Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T22:21:50Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"message":"Add useChatSessions hook\n\nIntroduce useChatSessions hook to manage chat session lifecycle: initializes the chat database, loads sessions, and creates a default session if none exist. Exposes state for sessions, activeSessionId, and isLoading, and provides handlers to select, create, remove (with fallback to create a new session if the active one is deleted), toggle pin, rename, and refresh sessions. Relies on chatDatabase service functions (initChatDatabase, listSessions, createSession, deleteSession, setSessionPinned, updateSessionTitle).","tree":{"sha":"2eef9dca4ce22f0a182f060fd4ad8d6841bc8b6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/trees/2eef9dca4ce22f0a182f060fd4ad8d6841bc8b6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/commits/a12409ef502ad813b87dd89e10f16c4482e86bd6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162027037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dileepapeiris","id":162027037,"login":"dileepapeiris","node_id":"U_kgDOCahWHQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commit/a12409ef502ad813b87dd89e10f16c4482e86bd6","node_id":"C_kwDOP_DE69oAKGExMjQwOWVmNTAyYWQ4MTNiODdkZDg5ZTEwZjE2YzQ0ODJlODZiZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commit/dcbab6a80c2135689dd7595815ac38763bfd5ff6","sha":"dcbab6a80c2135689dd7595815ac38763bfd5ff6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/dcbab6a80c2135689dd7595815ac38763bfd5ff6"}],"sha":"a12409ef502ad813b87dd89e10f16c4482e86bd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/a12409ef502ad813b87dd89e10f16c4482e86bd6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162027037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dileepapeiris","id":162027037,"login":"dileepapeiris","node_id":"U_kgDOCahWHQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/dcbab6a80c2135689dd7595815ac38763bfd5ff6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T22:21:36Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T22:21:36Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"message":"Add ChatSessionDrawer component\n\nIntroduce ChatSessionDrawer: a themed, animated left-side drawer for chat sessions. The component supports opening/closing animations, overlay tap-to-close, safe-area insets, search/filtering, create new session button, session selection, long-press options (rename/pin/unpin/delete) and a RenameSessionModal. Uses app constants and ChatThemePalette for styling and resets search/rename state when closed. Accessibility labels, pin indicators, and keyboard behavior for the session list are included.","tree":{"sha":"14502b1e559a1c67b68ce63476cb2a301d430471","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/trees/14502b1e559a1c67b68ce63476cb2a301d430471"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/commits/dcbab6a80c2135689dd7595815ac38763bfd5ff6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162027037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dileepapeiris","id":162027037,"login":"dileepapeiris","node_id":"U_kgDOCahWHQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commit/dcbab6a80c2135689dd7595815ac38763bfd5ff6","node_id":"C_kwDOP_DE69oAKGRjYmFiNmE4MGMyMTM1Njg5ZGQ3NTk1ODE1YWMzODc2M2JmZDVmZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commit/4f1ef7df4a4a48bb26a64211c7a9a49ccc59dc88","sha":"4f1ef7df4a4a48bb26a64211c7a9a49ccc59dc88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/4f1ef7df4a4a48bb26a64211c7a9a49ccc59dc88"}],"sha":"dcbab6a80c2135689dd7595815ac38763bfd5ff6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/dcbab6a80c2135689dd7595815ac38763bfd5ff6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162027037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dileepapeiris","id":162027037,"login":"dileepapeiris","node_id":"U_kgDOCahWHQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/commits/4f1ef7df4a4a48bb26a64211c7a9a49ccc59dc88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T22:20:10Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T22:20:10Z","email":"dileepapeiris5@gmail.com","name":"K.Dileepa Thushan Peiris"},"message":"Add chat database service with SQLite\n\nAdd frontend/services/chatDatabase.ts: a new SQLite-backed chat database layer using expo-sqlite and expo-crypto. Initializes chat.db (PRAGMA foreign_keys ON) and creates chat_sessions and chat_messages tables plus an index. Exposes init/reset helpers and full CRUD for sessions (create, list, get, updateTitle, pin/unpin, delete, touch) and messages (insert, list, update, truncate-from). Includes row-to-type mappers and deriveSessionTitle utility; session updated_at is touched on message changes and messages cascade-delete with sessions.","tree":{"sha":"b23b652c59117c7c19dfcac6c5d5ef158a29dbf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/trees/b23b652c59117c7c19dfcac6c5d5ef158a29dbf7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opensuperapp/opensuperapp/git/commits/4f1ef7df4a4a48bb26a64211c7a9a49ccc59dc88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162027037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dileepapeiris","id":162027037,"login":"dileepapeiris","node_id":"U_kgDOCahWHQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dileepapeiris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://